-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Отправляйтесь на Аллею Героев и поговорите с фельдмаршалом Афрасиаби.", Description AC enUS : "Go to the Valley of Heroes and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi." ; Wowhead enUS : "Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Stonebridge."
