-- AC datas : OLD Title : "Onwards to Northrend!", Title AC enUS : "Onwards to Northrend!" ; Wowhead enUS : "Wrath of the Lich King: Onwards to Northrend!",  OLD Description : "Welcome to the Wrath of the Lich King Friends and Family Alpha. Use the portals next to me to begin your journey into Northrend.$B$BYou can choose to report to the Horde recruiter in Warsong Hold in Borean Tundra or you can go to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord.", Description AC enUS : "Welcome to the Wrath of the Lich King Friends and Family Alpha.  Use the portals next to me to begin your journey into Northrend.$B$BYou can choose to report to the Horde recruiter in Warsong Hold in Borean Tundra or you can go to Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Speak to the Horde Recruiter inside Warsong Hold in Borean Tundra or Vengeance Landing in Howling Fjord."
