-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Если у тебя есть рекомендации от одного из наших маршалов, покажи их мне. Взамен я дам тебе пару Львиных перчаток.", Description AC enUS : "If you earn a commendation from one of our Marshals, then bring it to me.  It will be good for one of our Lion Emblem gloves." ; Wowhead enUS : "General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind will accept a commendation from Elwynn Forest.  Bringing him such a document will reward you with a choice of armor."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Генерал Маркус Джонатан в Штормграде готов принять у вас рекомендацию из Элвиннского леса. Принесите ему этот документ и в награду сможете выбрать себе доспех.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'ruRU' AND `ID` = 137;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "<UNUSED>", Title AC enUS : "<UNUSED>" ; Wowhead enUS : "<UNUSED>",  OLD Description : "As a child, raised as a gladiator at Durnholde Keep, I was befriended by Taretha, the daughter of my wet nurse and mistress of the damned bastard Blackmoore.$b$bThe past is the past, $n, but reports of human movements in Hillsbrad reminded me of that time. I dispatched a small party to the area to investigate and to retrieve an... item... given to me by Taretha, if they could.$b$bA fruitless task, no doubt, but perhaps...$b$bThey should have returned by now, I want you to go to Tarren Mill to investigate.", Description AC enUS : "As a child,raised as a gladiator at Durnholde Keep,I was befriended by Taretha,the daughter of my wet nurse and mistress of the damned bastard Blackmoore.$b$bThe past is the past,$n,but reports of human movements in Hillsbrad reminded me of that time. I dispatched a small party to the area to investigate and to retrieve an... item... given to me by Taretha,if they could.$b$bA fruitless task,no doubt,but perhaps...$b$bThey should have returned by now,I want you to go to Tarren Mill to investigate." ; Wowhead enUS : "Go to Tarren Mill and find out the status of the party sent by Thrall."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = NULL, `Details` = 'Отправляйтесь на Мельницу Таррен и выясните, что удалось узнать разведотряду Тралла.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'ruRU' AND `ID` = 497;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "<UNUSED>", Title AC enUS : "<UNUSED>" ; Wowhead enUS : "<UNUSED>",  OLD Description : "You would do well to learn how dangerous this land can be, |3-6($c).$B$BThe wildlife here can teach us such things... if we are wise and observant.$B$BThe scorpids are a perfect example of survival in Durotar. If you are to survive, it would be wise to take on some of their characteristics as your own. Their hardened carapaces can protect you from the harshness of the sun, or even a deadly weapon.$B$BBring me 6 Small Scorpid Carapaces from the Clattering Scorpids, $n, and I shall see about rewarding you justly.", Description AC enUS : "You would do well to learn how dangerous this land can be,$c.$B$BThe wildlife here can teach us such things... if we are wise and observant.$B$BThe scorpids are a perfect example of survival in Durotar. If you are to survive,it would be wise to take on some of their characteristics as your own. Their hardened carapaces can protect you from the harshness of the sun,or even a deadly weapon.$B$BBring me 6 Small Scorpid Carapaces from the Clattering Scorpids,$N,and I shall see about rewarding you justly." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 6 Small Scorpid Carapaces to Kor'ghan in Sen'jin Village."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Title` = NULL, `Details` = 'Принесите 6 малых скорпидских панцирей Кор''гхану в деревню Сен''джин.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'ruRU' AND `ID` = 810;
-- AC datas : OLD Title : "<UNUSED>", Title AC enUS : "<UNUSED>" ; Wowhead enUS : "<UNUSED>",  OLD Description : "Cook and clean--that's all I do!$B$BYou want to eat, you get me some more meat! I don't have all day to hunt and prepare food for all these louses. You got to learn to pull your own weight around here if you wanna be treated equal.$B$BGet me some Chunks of Boar Meat if you want to make yourself useful... or you don't want to starve to death.", Description AC enUS : "Cook and clean--that's all I do!$B$BYou want to eat,you get me some more meat! I don't have all day to hunt and prepare food for all these louses. You got to learn to pull your own weight around here if you wanna be treated equal.$B$BGet me some Chunks of Boar Meat if you want to make yourself useful... or you don't want to starve to death." ; Wowhead enUS : "Bring 10 Chunks of Boar Meat to Cook Torka in Razor Hill."
