-- AC datas : OLD Description : "Well, $n, you've been an enormous asset to the expedition so far. Debaar, Buck, and I couldn't have have assembled such an amazing collection of trophies without you.$B$BBut, I hear there are even fiercer monsters in other parts of the basin. I've sent a search party up north to get an idea of what other beasts await us.$B$BI'd like you to meet up with them and see what they've found. Head north, beyond Bittertide Lake and search for the encampment.", Description AC enUS : "Well, $N, you've been an enormous asset to the expedition so far. Debaar, Buck, and I couldn't have have assembled such an amazing collection of trophies without you.$B$BBut, I hear there are even fiercer monsters in other parts of the basin. I've sent a search party up north to get an idea of what other beasts await us.$B$BI'd like you to meet up with them and see what they've found. Head north, beyond Bittertide Lake and search for the encampment." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest was marked obsolete by Blizzard and cannot be obtained or completed.Talk to <x> at <x>."
UPDATE `quest_template_locale` SET `Details` = 'Blizzard пометили это задание как устаревшее — его нельзя получить или выполнить.Talk to <x> at <x>.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0 WHERE `locale` = 'ruRU' AND `ID` = 12586;
-- AC datas : OLD Description : "<Корвий отдает вам честь.>$B$BНаши запасы оружия, брони и амуниции практически полны. Мы готовы к войне!$B$B<Корвий сворачивает в рулон толстый лист пергамента.>$B$BС другой стороны этажа, на юго-западе располагаются офицерские казармы. Возьми этот доклад и отнеси его Таланору, командиру батальона Проклятых.", Description AC enUS : "<Corvus salutes.>$B$BOur stockpiles of weapons, armor and munitions are nearly at maximum capacity. We are ready for war!$B$B<Corvus rolls up a fleshy piece of vellum.>$B$BOn the other side of this garrison floor, southwest of here, you will find the officers' quarters. Take this status report there and deliver it to Scourge Commander Thalanor, battalion commander of the Company of the Damned." ; Wowhead enUS : "This quest is no longer available within the game.Deliver Corvus' Report to Scourge Commander Thalanor at the garrison floor of Ebon Hold."
